# Railway Deployment Configuration

## Benötigte Services
- Web Service (Backend)
- PostgreSQL Database

## Deployment Settings

### Build Command
```
npm install && npx prisma generate && npm run build
```

### Start Command
```
npx prisma migrate deploy && npm run start:prod
```

### Environment Variables
Siehe DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md

## Wichtig
- Node Version: 20.x
- Port: 3005 (automatisch von Railway erkannt via $PORT)
